OL,3,GNEWSAAccessible space award winner
OL,4,Ablocked from stage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA disability campaigner could not go on
OL,7,Fstage to receive her award after
OL,8,F"reasonable adjustment was not made".
OL,10,FJulie Fernandez, an access coordinator
OL,11,Fat Peterborough Presents, was
OL,12,Frecognised at the Cambridgeshire
OL,13,FChamber of Commerce Awards for her work
OL,14,Fmaking workspaces inclusive and
OL,15,Faccessible.
OL,17,FHowever, she said she felt disappointed
OL,18,Fand embarrassed when she could not
OL,19,Fcollect the accolade in her wheelchair
OL,20,Fon Thursday and said more work and
OL,21,Feducation is needed.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
