OL,3,GNEWSAAccessible space award winner
OL,4,Ablocked from stage
OL,5,
OL,6,FCambridgeshire Chamber of Commerce CEO
OL,7,FCharlotte Horobin said: "We are
OL,8,Fdisappointed that on this occasion we
OL,9,Fwere unable to meet the standard Ms
OL,10,FFernandez rightly expected. We
OL,11,Frecognise there is more we can do."
